{"id":"edf61bb893ee0ba7","group":"91","path":"91/91-thm-KF-minimal-fixed-point-characterization.md","title":"标准 KF 模型刻画及极小模型的地位","display":"thm-KF-minimal-fixed-point-characterization — 标准 KF 模型刻画及极小模型的地位","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth","book_abbrev":"91","label":"91-thm-KF-minimal-fixed-point-characterization","aliases":["91-thm-KF-minimal-fixed-point-characterization","91-thm-KF-fp-char","91-thm-KF-model"],"display":"thm-KF-minimal-fixed-point-characterization — 标准 KF 模型刻画及极小模型的地位","depends_on":["[[91-df-KF]]","[[91-df-jump-operator]]","[[91-df-minimal-fixed-point]]","[[91-df-KF-plus]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"91"},{"key":"label","html":"91-thm-KF-minimal-fixed-point-characterization"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>91-thm-KF-minimal-fixed-point-characterization</span><span>91-thm-KF-fp-char</span><span>91-thm-KF-model</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-KF-minimal-fixed-point-characterization — 标准 KF 模型刻画及极小模型的地位"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a0a2284f96eaea1d\" href=\"?note=a0a2284f96eaea1d\" title=\"91-df-KF\">91-df-KF</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"ae9eced0b12cbd2a\" href=\"?note=ae9eced0b12cbd2a\" title=\"91-df-jump-operator\">91-df-jump-operator</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"460308c7099a8386\" href=\"?note=460308c7099a8386\" title=\"91-df-minimal-fixed-point\">91-df-minimal-fixed-point</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"c6dd3bfc0bc402ea\" href=\"?note=c6dd3bfc0bc402ea\" title=\"91-df-KF-plus\">91-df-KF-plus</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CONS}=\\forall a\\,[D(a)\\to\\neg(T(a)\\land T(\\operatorname{neg}(a)))]\">\\(\\mathrm{CONS}=\\forall a\\,[D(a)\\to\\neg(T(a)\\land T(\\operatorname{neg}(a)))]\\)</span> 为 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"c6dd3bfc0bc402ea\" href=\"?note=c6dd3bfc0bc402ea\" title=\"91-df-KF-plus\">91-df-KF-plus</a> 的一致性公理。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\\subseteq C_T\">\\(X\\subseteq C_T\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"J\">\\(J\\)</span> 为原书 Definition 15.5 的生成算子；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak M_X^{\\mathrm{cl}}=(\\mathbb N,T\\mapsto X)\">\\(\\mathfrak M_X^{\\mathrm{cl}}=(\\mathbb N,T\\mapsto X)\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X_{\\min}\">\\(X_{\\min}\\)</span> 为最小固定点，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D=\\operatorname{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_T}\">\\(D=\\operatorname{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_T}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{KF}\">\\(\\mathrm{KF}\\)</span> 未加入 CONS。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}KF\\text{-}minimal\\text{-}fixed\\text{-}point\\text{-}characterization}\\vdash\\quad\n\\mathfrak M_X^{\\mathrm{cl}}\\models\\mathrm{KF}\\quad\\Longleftrightarrow\\quad J(X)=X.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}KF\\text{-}minimal\\text{-}fixed\\text{-}point\\text{-}characterization}\\vdash\\quad\n\\mathfrak M_X^{\\mathrm{cl}}\\models\\mathrm{KF}\\quad\\Longleftrightarrow\\quad J(X)=X.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak M_{X_{\\min}}^{\\mathrm{cl}}\\models\\mathrm{KF}+\\mathrm{CONS}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathfrak M_{X_{\\min}}^{\\mathrm{cl}}\\models\\mathrm{KF}+\\mathrm{CONS}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>因为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\\subseteq C_T\">\\(X\\subseteq C_T\\)</span>，结构中已满足真理适用域 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\forall a(T(a)\\to D(a))\">\\(\\forall a(T(a)\\to D(a))\\)</span>，故第一行是 Theorem 15.15 的完整等价，不只一个方向。反向由十三公理和 Lemma 15.6 的固定点成员条件得到；正向逐条验证十三公理。原书 Lemma 15.7 保证极小固定点信息一致，于是第二行成立。\nKF 刻画所有这样的标准固定点闭包，包括可含过剩者；它不唯一刻画极小固定点。对任意标准 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\\subseteq\\mathbb N\">\\(X\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\)</span> 若不先限 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C_T\">\\(C_T\\)</span>，则原书等价还必须加入真理适用域公理。</p>\n<p>来源：Theorem 15.15，印刷页 197，PDF 页 208；Lemmas 15.6–15.7、15.17。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"91-df-KF","status":"resolved","id":"a0a2284f96eaea1d","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-KF]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-jump-operator","status":"resolved","id":"ae9eced0b12cbd2a","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-jump-operator]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-minimal-fixed-point","status":"resolved","id":"460308c7099a8386","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-minimal-fixed-point]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-KF-plus","status":"resolved","id":"c6dd3bfc0bc402ea","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-KF-plus]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-KF-plus","status":"resolved","id":"c6dd3bfc0bc402ea","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{CONS}=\\forall a\\,[D(a)\\to\\neg(T(a)\\land T(\\operatorname{neg}(a)))]$ 为 [[91-df-KF-plus]] 的一致性公理。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{CONS}=\\forall a\\,[D(a)\\to\\neg(T(a)\\land T(\\operatorname{neg}(a)))]","display":false},{"tex":"X\\subseteq C_T","display":false},{"tex":"J","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathfrak M_X^{\\mathrm{cl}}=(\\mathbb N,T\\mapsto X)","display":false},{"tex":"X_{\\min}","display":false},{"tex":"D=\\operatorname{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_T}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{KF}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}KF\\text{-}minimal\\text{-}fixed\\text{-}point\\text{-}characterization}\\vdash\\quad\n\\mathfrak M_X^{\\mathrm{cl}}\\models\\mathrm{KF}\\quad\\Longleftrightarrow\\quad J(X)=X.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathfrak M_{X_{\\min}}^{\\mathrm{cl}}\\models\\mathrm{KF}+\\mathrm{CONS}.","display":true},{"tex":"X\\subseteq C_T","display":false},{"tex":"\\forall a(T(a)\\to D(a))","display":false},{"tex":"X\\subseteq\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"C_T","display":false}],"bytes":1886,"backlinks":[{"id":"cb582ee79087af80","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"d12ffdb5e1b32a31","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"4278731e7fc892de","anchor":"ref-137","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[91-thm-KF-minimal-fixed-point-characterization]]"},{"id":"e93fc3e2f8fd50d4","anchor":"ref-128","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[91-thm-CT-conservative.md]]\n[[91-thm-FS-consistency.md]]\n[[91-thm-FS-necessity-adequacy.md]]\n[[91-thm-FS-omega-consistency.md]]\n[[91-thm-FS-strength.md]]\n[[91-thm-KF-consistency.md]]\n[[91-thm-KF-minimal-fixed-point-characterization.md]]\n[[91-thm-KF-proves-PA-consistency.md]]\n[[91-thm-KF-soundness.md]]\n[[91-thm-McGee.md]]\n[[91-thm-T-schema-consistency.md]]\n[[91-thm-T-schema-partial-recovery.md]]\n[[91-thm-TB-completeness.md]]\n[[91-thm-Tarski-undefinability.md]]\n[[91-thm-VF-KF-equivalence.md]]\n[[91-thm-VF-conservative.md]]\n[[91-thm-compositional-completeness.md]]\n[[91-thm-conservative-extension-axioms.md]]\n[[91-thm-diagonal-lemma.md]]\n[[91-thm-fixed-point-existence.md]]\n[[91-thm-fixed-point-lattic